},{"id":"2775","date":"2025-10-30T12:23:25+00:00","text":"​​ #JWST imaging has identified a large #DebrisDisk around the nearby M-dwarf TWA 20, highlighting the telescope’s ability to detect faint, cool disks around low-luminosity stars. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2774","date":"2025-10-01T13:20:51+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2773","date":"2025-10-01T13:20:48+00:00","text":"​​ #A new AI tensor network framework enables direct, rapid calculation of the configurational integral in statistical physics, achieving results over 400 times faster than traditional simulations ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2772","date":"2025-09-27T14:51:29+00:00","text":"Thodi si hasi, thoda sa mazaak, Memes ke bina life lagti hai paak, yaha milega full dose mastii ka. Bas forward karo aur bano hero apne dosto ka&#33; 💯 🔥 Join Now : https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb18bviEQIanKWNp5d27","image":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/jX1z8MnHmIZepruxeqi3nVu6IVid_OmImQwWcNYGKDTVrC_h8qijuYa456Yhk8pOUQ9Ckyyltq3kznjAhyEvZdocg8Sao9YF1KBf-Ku_1HzwUgAEaqab2mcfD4xsbatDKCEmZnkO3Lgo3tsApi-Xf2tacGeXlTR8L3F-22zTRkFiH1vFA6JSOrUAxr_aq-z5AKFO8RiKKO6p7iC27JU6aQp_fTKslR25jG4C2NPo4LPgR8IeucQp62aDJyc6UBP7zBh05T-yad1VM9lMoRFd9sdAUDEUyguUU3IYBLC4ukYE49NiWdXreuOAKNfj6ZuPYXLU2we0eaeGaoJtZy2xDA.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2771","date":"2025-09-17T13:03:25+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2770","date":"2025-09-17T13:03:20+00:00","text":"​​ #A rare Einstein cross with a fifth image has been observed, indicating the presence of a massive, hidden dark matter halo and offering new insights into the universe’s invisible structure. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2769","date":"2025-09-07T15:07:32+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2768","date":"2025-09-07T15:07:29+00:00","text":"​​ #ALMA observations of a protostar in the #MilkyWay ’s outer region reveal that while #StarFormation physics is universal, local chemistry varies with environment and metallicity. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2767","date":"2025-09-04T14:29:50+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2766","date":"2025-09-04T14:29:47+00:00","text":"​​ #Real -time observation of #NuclearSpin switching in a single atom demonstrates unprecedented stability, advancing prospects for atomic-scale quantum sensing and control. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2765","date":"2025-08-30T12:16:25+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2764","date":"2025-08-30T12:16:19+00:00","text":"​​ #Jade dental inlays, previously thought to be exclusive to adult Maya, have now been identified in children’s #Teeth , suggesting more complex and varied #CulturalPractices than previously recognized. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2763","date":"2025-08-26T13:07:37+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2762","date":"2025-08-26T13:07:33+00:00","text":"​​ #The Inouye Solar Telescope has captured the smallest #CoronalLoops ever imaged during a solar flare, offering unprecedented detail that could transform models of the sun’s magnetic structure. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2761","date":"2025-08-22T13:24:42+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2760","date":"2025-08-22T13:24:40+00:00","text":"​​ #A new cosmological model suggests #BlackHoles may convert infalling matter into #DarkEnergy , potentially explaining both dark energy’s evolution and the true mass of neutrinos in the universe. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2759","date":"2025-08-17T12:34:08+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2758","date":"2025-08-17T12:34:05+00:00","text":"​​ #High -resolution paleoclimate simulations show that crater lakes in the Tibesti Mountains persisted for millennia due to intense precipitation from Mediterranean air masses during the Holocene. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2757","date":"2025-08-15T13:53:39+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2756","date":"2025-08-15T13:53:36+00:00","text":"​​ #A new carbon allotrope, cyclo[48]carbon catenane, has been synthesized and shown to be stable in solution at room temperature, enabling detailed spectroscopic analysis under standard conditions. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2755","date":"2025-08-14T13:23:29+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2754","date":"2025-08-14T13:23:24+00:00","text":"​​ #Chemical analysis of a Yucatán cave #Stalagmite identifies eight multi-year wet season droughts, including one lasting 13 years, coinciding with the societal decline of the Classic Maya civilization. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2753","date":"2025-08-12T12:53:39+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2752","date":"2025-08-12T12:53:36+00:00","text":"​​ #GeochemicalAnalysis of a Viking #Silver hoard from North Yorkshire shows nearly a third of the silver originated from Islamic dirhams, highlighting extensive Viking trade networks across Eurasia. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2751","date":"2025-08-11T12:55:39+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2750","date":"2025-08-11T12:55:34+00:00","text":"​​ #Water confined to just a few molecular layers retains bulk-like properties, with surface chemistry—not spatial confinement—governing its structure until thickness drops below a nanometer. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2749","date":"2025-08-10T13:18:40+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2748","date":"2025-08-10T13:18:37+00:00","text":"​​ RogueWaves are not oceanic anomalies but result from the rare alignment of ordinary wave patterns. New analysis shows these #ExtremeEvents follow natural, predictable physics. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2747","date":"2025-08-09T13:51:22+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2746","date":"2025-08-09T13:51:17+00:00","text":"​​ #Evidence suggests #Subduction and continental #Crust formation were active during the Hadean Eon, indicating plate tectonics may have started hundreds of millions of years earlier than previously thought. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2745","date":"2025-08-07T12:43:12+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2744","date":"2025-08-07T12:43:08+00:00","text":"​​ #Gold #Hydride , a compound of gold and hydrogen, has been synthesized under extreme pressure and temperature, revealing new chemistry and insights into dense hydrogen found in planetary interiors. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2743","date":"2025-08-06T13:28:55+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2732","date":"2025-07-31T13:10:25+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2731","date":"2025-07-31T13:10:22+00:00","text":"​​ #CosmicRays may provide enough energy to support #MicroscopicLife beneath the surfaces of Mars and icy moons, expanding the potential habitats for life beyond regions with sunlight or volcanic heat. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2730","date":"2025-07-30T12:50:36+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2729","date":"2025-07-30T12:50:33+00:00","text":"​​ #A new #Fusion reactor concept proposes transmuting mercury into #Gold while generating clean energy, potentially doubling fusion plant revenue and reducing the need for environmentally harmful gold mining. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2728","date":"2025-07-28T09:55:17+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2727","date":"2025-07-28T09:55:14+00:00","text":"​​ #Despite the introduction of rice and #Millet farming to ancient Japan, culinary traditions persisted, with millet largely absent from diets and established food practices remaining unchanged for centuries. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2726","date":"2025-07-26T09:37:16+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2725","date":"2025-07-26T09:37:10+00:00","text":"​​ #A newly identified quantum state in hafnium pentatelluride demonstrates unique electron-hole pairing, potentially enabling radiation-resistant, self-charging computers for deep space applications. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2724","date":"2025-07-24T10:40:07+00:00","text":"","image":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2723","date":"2025-07-24T10:40:02+00:00","text":"​​ #Fossil evidence from China suggests some #HerbivorousDinosaurs , like Pulaosaurus qinglong, produced bird-like chirps rather than roars, reshaping our understanding of dinosaur vocalization. ✅ Source : Click here ━━━━━━━━━━━ ☢ @Physics ⚡","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false}]